  {
   "key": "federal-representatives-931",
   "date": "2011-10-11",
   "house": "representatives",
   "question": "The majority voted in favour of a motion to suspend Liberal MP [Sophie Mirabella](http://publicwhip-rails.openaustraliafoundation.org.au/mp.php?mpn=Sophie_Mirabella&display=summary) from the service of the House, which was moved by Labor MP [Greg Combet](http://publicwhip-rails.openaustraliafoundation.org.au/mp.php?mpn=Greg_Combet&display=summary). This means that MP Mirabella is suspended from the service of the House for 24 hours and has to leave the House for that time.(You can read more about orders to suspend from the service of the House [here](http://www.aph.gov.au/binaries/house/pubs/gtp/pdf/chapter7.pdf) (417 KB). ) _Background to the motion_ This motion occurred after MP Mirabella was warned by the Deputy Speaker for continuing to speak after her allotted time had expired.(You can see this debate [here](http://www.openaustralia.org/debates/?id=2011-10-11.81.1), starting from 10:09 pm.) References",
